1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,173
MAN: Hello. This morning, I received a box of clothes I ordered from your company,

2
00:00:04,173 --> 00:00:05,680
but there's a slight problem

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:09,180
When I opened the box, one of the items I ordered was missing.

4
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:12,060
WOMAN: I'm terribly sorry to hear that, sir

5
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:15,090
Could you give me your personal information, please?

6
00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:17,220
MAN: My name is Ian Caldwell

7
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:27,060
and my order number was 98449-12. The missing item was product number CR403.

8
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:30,480
WOMAN: All right. We're going to send you the item by express mail

9
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:32,160
It should arrive by Thursday.

10
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:34,270
MAN: Excellent. I really appreciate it.

11
00:00:34,270 --> 00:00:42,160
WOMAN: I'll also include a coupon good for twenty percent off your next order as our way of apologizing.
